<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:width="96dp"
    android:height="96dp"
    android:viewportWidth="24"
    android:viewportHeight="24">
    <!--
        The brand gem at splash size: the same cut and the same four facets as ic_x_gem, restated
        at 96dp intrinsic because a layer-list centres a drawable at its intrinsic bounds and the
        24dp original would sit as a speck in the middle of the launch window. Kept as a copy
        rather than scaled at draw time so the splash needs nothing but resources: the launch
        window is drawn by the system before any of our code runs, which is the whole reason it
        appears instantly.
    -->
    <path
        android:pathData="M12,3L7,8H17Z"
        android:fillColor="#E3CAF0"/>
    <path
        android:pathData="M7,8H17L21,11H3Z"
        android:fillColor="#C08CE8"/>
    <path
        android:pathData="M3,11H21L12,21Z"
        android:fillColor="#9649B8"/>
    <path
        android:pathData="M3,11H12L12,21Z"
        android:fillColor="#A855F7"/>
</vector>
